WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.541 --> 00:00:05.458
The world is accelerating into an era
profoundly shaped

2
00:00:05.458 --> 00:00:07.250
by Artificial Intelligence.

3
00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:11.000
Its incredible progress
brings an immense, ever-growing demand

4
00:00:11.125 --> 00:00:14.250
for computational power, with AI workloads

5
00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:17.875
requiring a fourfold increase
in compute power every single year.

6
00:00:18.541 --> 00:00:22.500
Such a relentless surge is pushing
traditional data center designs to their

7
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:27.583
limits, leading to fragmentation,
increased costs, and hindered innovation.

8
00:00:28.583 --> 00:00:30.583
To meet this monumental challenge,

9
00:00:30.666 --> 00:00:33.666
OCP is leading
a fundamental transformation.

10
00:00:34.083 --> 00:00:38.000
Through our Open Systems for
AI Strategic Initiative, we are building

11
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.416
a blueprint for next-generation
AI factories and their AI infrastructure.

12
00:00:43.708 --> 00:00:46.916
Our integrated strategic vision
coordinates our 12 active

13
00:00:46.916 --> 00:00:52.250
OCP projects across three core domains: IT
Infrastructure,

14
00:00:52.875 --> 00:00:55.875
Physical Infrastructure,
and System Management.

15
00:00:56.541 --> 00:01:00.083
This collaborative approach ensures
our designs are inherently open,

16
00:01:00.416 --> 00:01:03.250
highly efficient, and incredibly scalable.

17
00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:06.333
Our vision directly tackles AI's core
demands,

18
00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:09.541
pushing beyond today’s specifications.

19
00:01:09.541 --> 00:01:14.375
We're standardizing rack architectures
to support unprecedented power envelopes,

20
00:01:14.791 --> 00:01:19.041
from 250 kilowatts
all the way up to one megawatt per rack.

21
00:01:19.791 --> 00:01:24.208
To put that in perspective,
imagine a single rack’s power equating

22
00:01:24.208 --> 00:01:28.208
to powering an entire neighbourhood
– that’s the scale we're talking about!

23
00:01:28.875 --> 00:01:30.333
Achieving this requires

24
00:01:30.333 --> 00:01:34.125
rethinking every aspect of physical design
and thermal management.

25
00:01:34.125 --> 00:01:38.583
To manage the immense heat
generated by these high-powered,

26
00:01:38.583 --> 00:01:42.750
highly dense systems, we're pioneering
advanced liquid cooling solutions.

27
00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:44.458
Think of the

28
00:01:44.458 --> 00:01:47.458
accelerator chips
like a highly efficient car engine,

29
00:01:47.541 --> 00:01:51.500
but with precision-controlled liquid
directly cooling the hottest components,

30
00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:55.250
extracting heat
with unparalleled effectiveness.

31
00:01:55.833 --> 00:01:58.833
We're also transforming power delivery
with Vertical Power Delivery,

32
00:01:59.208 --> 00:02:02.458
a breakthrough that brings power
directly to the chip from below,

33
00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:05.333
drastically reducing energy loss.

34
00:02:05.333 --> 00:02:09.583
But power is only one part of the equation.
Once a chip is powered,

35
02:09.750 --> 02:14.000
it needs to communicate at lightning-fast
speeds to handle complex AI requests.

36
02:15.000 --> 02:19.041
OCP is driving the development
of multiple, evolving network fabrics,

37
02:19.333 --> 02:22.250
like SUE and UALink for scaling up

38
02:22.250 --> 02:26.041
within a pod, and Ultra Ethernet
for scaling out to massive clusters.

39
02:26.416 --> 02:31.083
Beyond infrastructure and hardware, OCP
is committed to full-stack development,

40
02:31.083 --> 02:35.166
creating more universal
and open systems for AI.

41
02:35.250 --> 02:39.083
This involves developing
standardized software abstraction layers,

42
02:39.416 --> 02:42.625
allowing developers to work with diverse
AI hardware

43
02:42.833 --> 02:45.500
without needing custom interfaces.

44
02:45.500 --> 02:47.833
We’re building
comprehensive management frameworks

45
02:47.833 --> 02:50.833
that enable more autonomous
orchestration of operations,

46
02:51.291 --> 02:54.500
monitoring every note
and making real-time adjustments.

47
02:55.166 --> 02:58.583
This ensures continuous control
and optimal performance,

48
02:59.083 --> 03:00.958
even if components go offline.

49
03:00.958 --> 03:06.750
The OCP model thrives on community-driven
collaboration, inviting

50
03:06.750 --> 03:12.583
contributions from component designers,
silicon innovators, system integrators,

51
03:13.291 --> 03:17.666
data centre operators, hyperscalers
and neoclouds across the globe.

52
03:17.750 --> 03:21.750
The collective expertise reduces
wasted investment and creates

53
03:21.750 --> 03:25.791
a clear pipeline from innovative ideas
to deployable solutions.

54
03:26.750 --> 03:29.625
Our success
isn't just about technical gains;

55
03:29.625 --> 03:32.625
it's about the democratization of AI.

56
03:33.000 --> 03:36.291
Whether you’re building
hyperscale clusters or starting small,

57
03:36.750 --> 03:40.125
the same trusted, open designs
can power your mission,

58
03:40.541 --> 03:43.541
and do so efficiently,
affordably, and securely.

59
03:43.875 --> 03:47.791
With openness, collaboration,
and community at its core,

60
03:48.208 --> 03:52.791
The OCP Open Systems for AI
initiative is laying the groundwork

61
03:52.791 --> 03:57.416
for global innovation and a future
where interoperable systems are the norm.